        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy YuE 2\n\nGenerate audio on Comfy Cloud with the official YuE 2 template. Requires COMFY_API_KEY and model availability on Comfy Cloud.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete YuE 2 graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its generated audio.\n\n**Try this:** Change value on Text (Style) and run again to compare results. Edit the visible nodes to change settings, lyrics or duration.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/benchmarks/audio_yue2_text2music.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
